the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 8.

the events are:
    runaway.
    notices.
    save the five.

the actions are:
    divert.
    *a thing* pushes; known as push.
    do nothing.

the fluents are:
    the trolley on is *a thing*; known as trolley_on.
    *a thing* is people on; known as people_on.
    *a thing* is alive; known as alive.
    the dead is *a thing*; known as dead.

the knowledge base trolley includes:

initially the trolley on is main
    and main is people on
    and side is people on
    and five is alive
    and one is alive
    and bystander is alive.

when divert
then the trolley on that is a thing becomes side.

when a thing pushes
then the trolley on that is a second thing becomes side.

when divert
then it is not the case that one is alive.

when divert
then the dead is one.

when do nothing
then it is not the case that five is alive.

when do nothing
then the dead is five.

when a thing pushes
then it is not the case that the thing is alive.

when a thing pushes
then the dead is the thing.

save the five from a time to a second time if
    bystander pushes from the time to the second time.

save the five from a time to a second time if
    divert from the time to the second time.

if the trolley on is main
    and five is alive
then save the five.

it must not be true that
    a thing pushes.


scenario one is:
    runaway from 2 to 3.
